window.products.push({"id":1157002,"name":"Palace Imports 100% Solid Wood Reston Panel Headboard Platform Bed, Full Size, Mahogany, 12 Slats Included. Requires Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gr9L2i5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Reston full platform bed comes complete with twelve wooden slats engineered to support and extend the life of any standard full mattress. It's a great addition to any bedroom it adorns. The craftsmanship of the Reston full platform bed is enhanced by its aesthetically pleasing‚ all wood construction. The precision carved‚ solid wood panel headboard is substantial‚ sturdy‚ and offers good pillow support‚ helping you drift off to a sound sleep. The beauty of 100% pine wood is enriched by a hand painted finish which gives it a silky smooth feel. The Reston is available in twin and full sizes as well as five colors. It can complement an existing room or be paired with other perfectly compatible furniture pieces from Palace Imports. With our one-year worry free warranty‚ you can rest easy in your Reston twin platform bed. Overall Size: Standard full 79.25\"l x 57\"w x 40.5\"h Stain Finishes: White‚ Mahogany‚ Mocha‚ Honey Pine‚ Java 20% gloss Wood Samples: As actual color may vary‚ wood samples can be mailed out for color matching and wood quality assessment Construction and Features: 12 pine wood slats included 12 pine wood slats included Solid wood panel headboard carved with CNC router Solid wood panel headboard carved with CNC router Each slat is attached to rails individually creating a strong rigid structure Each slat is attached to rails individually creating a strong rigid structure 3/4\" thick rails 3/4\" thick rails 2.5\" by 2.5\" posts 2.5\" by 2.5\" posts Metal‐to‐metal rail to post connections for better security Metal‐to‐metal rail to post connections for better security Ships Ready‐to‐assemble (RTA) in 2 boxes and requires assembly Ships Ready‐to‐assemble (RTA) in 2 boxes and requires assembly Wood: 100% Brazilian farm grown pine wood kiln dried to prevent splitting and size distortion ‐MADE IN BRAZIL‐","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gr9L2i5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B00H5WYGOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H5WYGOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H5WYGOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157003,"name":"XOTO 20 Pack Reusable Vacuum Sealing Hand-Pump Sous Vide Kit Including 20 Assorted Size Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NrepGBgDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"et restaurant quality results at home with Xoto! The Xoto Vacuum Sealer pump keeps your food fresh up to 2x longer while also being the perfect accessory for sous vide immersion cooking! Our pump is incredibly easy to use and doesn’t require batteries or space-consuming cords; simply pump with your hands! The reusable valves keep liquids in and air out and best of all, they can be used on any conventional sealable bag to make it vacuum sealable. With this pack, you receive 4 bag sealing clips, 4 stainless steel clamps and sets of 4 bag each with integrated air valves: 5 x (8.12” x 8.5”), 5 x (11” x 10.12”), 5 x (13.25” x 10”) & 5x (13.25” x 11.65”). Xoto gives you the edge!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NrepGBgDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VViViD","source_asin":"B07RH93342","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RH93342","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RH93342","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157004,"name":"Ultimate Sleep 100% Natural Latex Topper Mattress Pad for Comfort Bedding | Medium Firm | (King 3 inch) (5.9 lb Density)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":729.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWrLpS64L._AC_SL1104_.jpg","description":"Latex is known for its longevity, durability, resilience, and luxury feel. Because latex is so springy and resilient, it is appropriate for heavier body weights, as it will spring back and recover time and again. Latex also tends to have a more firm feel, making it ideal for those who like a firm sleep surface. Our cozy natural latex toppers are springy yet soft. Certified Pure and Natural by EcoInstitut. These toppers are \"zoned\" for superior comfort cushioning, and the larger holes should go where there is less body weight. Although we have not promoted them as offering Advanced Orthopedic Support, that the reason behind this technology. Regions with larger holes are intended to offer slightly softened support for the head and other sensitive and less heavy areas; sections with smaller holes will have slightly more firm support for heavier body regions such as the hips and chest. 30 Day Trial Period, Never Any Restocking Fees!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWrLpS64L._AC_SL1104_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ultimate Sleep","source_asin":"B007PKCI9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007PKCI9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007PKCI9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157005,"name":"2\"x5\" Smooth Beeswax Pillar - 100% Pure Beeswax, hand-poured and family-run - by Gammy's Beezwax Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oOz37ReoL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is our lovely 2\"x5\" Smooth Pillar Candle. This 100% beeswax candles burns for approximately 60+ hours. CANDLE CARE: This candle is perfect for burning 1-3 hours at a time and requires a heat resistant plate. Trim wick to 1/4\" before lighting and may need to be trimmed as it's lit (so, extinguish, trim and relight). CANDLE CARE: To extinguish candle, use a metal tool to dunk the wick into the melted wax. Make sure you push the wick up for easy relighting. For even burning, ensure holder is on a level and sturdy surface, plus there are no drafts in the room. REMEMBER: Never leave a lit candle unattended! Also keep out of reach from children and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oOz37ReoL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B08BY3G1BD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BY3G1BD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BY3G1BD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
