window.products.push({"id":1157150,"name":"Throw Pillows - Advice from a Bear Reversible Throw Pillow - Lodge Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512AW0cb2NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Not since Smokey the Bear has such sage advice been imparted by a forest creature! Our handsome reversible word pillow showcases a bear offering friendly advice on both the front and back. Proudly woven in the USA of a cotton/polyester blend. Measures approximately 12.5\"L x 8.5\"H. PLEASE NOTE: The main photograph shows two pillows so that you are able to view both the front side and the back side of this reversible pillow at once. This pillow is reversible and you are purchasing only one pillow from this listing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512AW0cb2NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KensingtonRow Lake & Lodge Collection","source_asin":"B00KLIP3D0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KLIP3D0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KLIP3D0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157151,"name":"Xplorer Maps San Francisco Bay Hand-Drawn Map - Authentic 18x24 Vintage-Style Wall Art - Lithographic Print with Soy-Based Inks - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WOtvAFAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PHILANTHROPY-GIVING BACK FOR OUR PUBLIC LANDS - As members of 1% For The Planet, Xplorer Maps donates a percentage of proceeds from every product we sell to a variety of non-profit organizations around the world. All of these organizations have similar missions as we do; focused on the conservation, preservation, and education of our Public Lands. Xplorer Maps has donated more than $100K to more than 37 different organizations since we began 10 years ago. MATERIALS - For all of our signed and numbered Limited Edition giclee prints, we use only the absolute finest reproduction paper in the industry. MUSEO MAX is a 100% cotton-heavy rag paper with absolutely no optical brighteners. These giclee prints represent the finest original artwork reproduction in the industry and will appreciate in value by approximately 5% annually for a true investment in art. PACKAGE - Every print is shipped in our unique and distinct “illustrated tube” that is safe and convenient for shipping, and travel as they fit in all standard carry-on luggage. 100% CUSTOM ART - A lot of map art is simply stock or \"open source\" imagery with a logo or small piece of custom art overlayed so that it can then be marketed as \"original, custom, art\". Xplorer Maps is different. Every single line, letter, and image has been intricately rendered entirely by hand. Each is unique and original to every new map we create. These maps are truly custom and one of a kind! THE ART PROCESS - The medium used by world-renowned illustrator Chris Robitaille for these hand-drawn maps is pen & ink with multiple layers of watercolor washes. Depending on the depth of detail in the map being rendered, the actual art process takes anywhere from 5-8 weeks. The end result is an entirely custom, unique, and original piece of art that has been fully vetted for \"educational merit, historical and geographic accuracy, and cultural relevance. PERFECT GIFT IDEA - At Xplorer Maps, we strive to make meaningful connections between our hand-drawn \"story\" maps and your personal travel and life experiences. Surprise your family, friends, neighbors, business colleagues, or loved ones. The perfect gift for map lovers, history and geography buffs, travelers, and teachers. Also becoming super popular as Home Decor for your VRBO or Airbnb rentals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WOtvAFAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xplorer Maps","source_asin":"B01AVGPBBA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AVGPBBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AVGPBBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
