window.products.push({"id":1157190,"name":"Blue 1st Birthday high chair banner - Boho 1st birthday decor for boys, Tassel and canvas bunting, Boy Cake smash Garland","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PXw4NKKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DESCRIPTION Our Brand Values We help you create your own special moments and enjoy fulfilling; strikingly memorable celebrations. Our philosophy is based on a concept that every item should be personalized to celebrate your special occasions and parties. 1 .We carry unique modern party decor and home decor; we specialize in birthday parties; baby showers; bridal showers; and weddings. All of our items are handmade to add that little extra touch of detail to impress your party guests. 2 .It is our goal to bring fresh; new; and inspiring designs to the party. We aim for creative excellence so that you can perfectly express yourself when ordering a piece from us. 3 .In the product selection process; we take the user’s experience and safety as the first consideration. All products are made of safe and good-quality materials and we never cut corners. Our hand-crafted pieces are truly a keepsake. MAKE EVERY MOMENT AS UNFORGETTABLE AS IT IS HEARTFELT. 1 .I want the children to have an enchanted childhood filled with so much joy; I want them to enjoy being children. When they see that party decor created for them; I want to know that I helped bring that special smile. 2 .This product can be used in scenes such as baby birthday; daily dress up; photography background; etc. It is a perfect party decoration 3 .This product is also a good choice for gifts. Your wishes can be expressed through this product. SPECIFICATION Material: canvas, tassel PRODUCTS SIZE AND PRODUCTS IN THE PACKAGE 1 x high chair banner; 78*9 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PXw4NKKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Agkvw","source_asin":"B0BLRTYPYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLRTYPYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLRTYPYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
