window.products.push({"id":1157293,"name":"Dalmatian Dog by Lanre Adefioye, 24x32-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817fE5xJjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful patterned portrait of a Dalmatian Lanre is a Nigerian Canadian neo pop artist, painter, sculptor and a product designer. He gained experience in the fields of graphic and product design before turning to painting. A visit with a master artist as a teenager inspired him to take action and to broaden his creative quest. Lanre searched and experimented relentlessly with new ways to depict his art. Lanres art is inspirational and philosophical, he combines elements of cubism and pop art in his work using vibrant colors and bold patterns as a visual expression of hope, joy, peace and love. His past, present and future inspire him to work hard on his craft. Lanreï¿½s art is therapeutic, opening the mind to new possibilities, creating energy and providing comfort to the soul and spirit. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817fE5xJjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07D76CT67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D76CT67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D76CT67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
