window.products.push({"id":1157385,"name":"Queen Elizabeth I and Robert Dudley - World Famous Painting Replica Print On Canvas Giclee Artwork Ready to Hang for Modern Home Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kaeqtJGwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Brife Introduction Canvas print, also known as stretched canvas or canvas art, is the result of an image printed onto canvas using fine art inkjet printers which is stretched, or mirror-wrapped, onto a frame and displayed. Printing Method We print our canvases using the giclée method. Giclée (zhee-klay) is a term invented in the early 1990s to distinguish high quality inkjet prints from common inkjet prints.  The giclée printing process provides better color accuracy than other means of reproduction, as well as last a lot longer. Giclée printing is the current industry standard for fine quality reproductions. High quality printed on canvas with lively color stretched and stapled to durable shrink resistant frames to create the look and feel of the original nature masterpiece. The canvas print s already perfectly stretched on wooden frame with hooks mounted on each panel for easy hanging out of box. Canvas Wall Art sets and Canvas paintings are the modern way to decorate the walls of your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kaeqtJGwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart for Life","source_asin":"B06XHBRYD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHBRYD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHBRYD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157386,"name":"Isolator Fitness ISOHARNESS (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FzLQldm9L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Take your ISOBAG with you to the gym, the outdoors, or to and from work using Isolator’s Harness. With the comfortable, 4-way adjustable harness, fitness and outdoor enthusiasts can carry their ISOBAG without pulling a muscle. The multipurpose design accommodates a number of other ISOBAG accessories to turn your meal management system into an all-purpose storage system. When paired with the Sidekick, you’ll enjoy extra room for storing clothes, shoes, and even your laptop. The Harness opens up incredible organization and storage potential just by snapping on to your ISOBAG. Fitness enthusiasts and those planning for longer trips will find room for all their essentials—preplanned meals, spare outfits, water bottles, and more. Our Harness attaches where the stock shoulder strap is placed and boasts 4-way adjustability for a custom fit. With its full range of colors and available Mossy Oak and Military patterns, the harness coordinates with our line of available ISOBAG designs effortlessly. Mix and match colors to customize your look and show your dedication to staying fit with your new meal management system. Isolator Fitness is highly recognized in the fitness industry for the quality and durability of there products. You will find some of the top athletes and companies utilizing our meal management systems, such as 4X Mr. Olympia Phil Heath, 10X bikini champion and cover model Amanda Latona, Gifted Athletics, Species Nutrition and many more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FzLQldm9L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isolator Fitness","source_asin":"B00ITWFQ9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ITWFQ9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ITWFQ9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
