window.products.push({"id":1157422,"name":"Insulated Coffee Mug, 14 Oz Stainless Steel Coffee Mug With Lid Handle & Soft Handle Cover, Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mugs Spill Proof BPA-F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7161yALR5XL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"✅【Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mug】: the 14oz coffee cap is made of premium food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, which provides with double-wall vacuum insulation to keep your favorite beverages hot for 3+ hours and cold for 9+ hours, also can repel stains and odors, meaning your lemonade won't taste like yesterday's coffee. Moreover, it makes the mug durable and not easy to break. ✅【Stainless Steel Coffee Mug With Soft Wide Handle】: Owing to the wild silica gel full-loop handle, AIDEAMART coffee mug is comfort-grip, non-slippery, free of metal cold feeling and is more comfortable to grip, making it easy to drink from. Coffee cup with handle and lid is a great outdoor travel mug and perfect coffee mug in home and office. ✅【Splash-proof & BPA Free Flip-top Lid】: The coffee tumbler comes with a DUST-PROOF press-in lid made from BPA-Free Tritan material. For this lid, we have two rubber gaskets for you to improve the spill-proof performance, which can help keep your wine or coffee from sloshing out. In addition, through the flip-top lid, you can use straw, sip, drink and enjoy your coffee or other drinks in any way you like. And you can easily see how much of your drink have left through durable clear lid. ✅【Matte Powder Coated & Sweat Free】This coffee tumbler never sweats or fades with durable premium powder coating techology for additional texture and durability. The No Sweat design ensures your hands stay dry. If you are a coffee addict who can drink more freshly brewed hot coffee a day, the mug will justify your expectations and does not sweat. If you are an icy beer lover, your hand will never get frostnip. ✅【Elegant Gift & 100% Customer Satisfaction】: All the stainless steel mug by AIDEAMART is coated with a stylish matte finish and laser logo. Some cups are designed with beautiful 3D patterns and personalized quotation language. Great for fast and simple use, personalized party favors, backyard BBQs, his-and-hers gifts, Father's Day and Mother's Day gifts. if you are not fully satisfied with your purchase, just feel free to contact us. We will make every effort to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7161yALR5XL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDEAMART","source_asin":"B08V5MKJRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V5MKJRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V5MKJRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
