window.products.push({"id":1157450,"name":"Slumber Solutions Gel 4-inch Memory Foam and 1.5-inch Fiber Mattress Topper Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":167.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JiAfBg78S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Revitalize your old mattress with this memory foam mattress topper from Slumber Solutions. Designed with gel memory foam, this four-inch mattress topper reduces pressure points to keep you comfortable at night. The mattress topper is also temperature sensitive, so it adjusts to your body temperature to keep you cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter.Type: Gel memory foamMeasures 5.5 inches thick, 4 inches of gel memory foam plus 1.5 inch fiber filled coverDensity: 3.2 pounds Originally designed for NASA, this foam reduces pressure points that cause tossing and turningTemperature sensitive foam adjusts to body temperature Draws uncomfortable warm air away from body Cover offers 3-inch gusset, stretch-to-fit 17-inch contour skirtEliminates motion transferHelps rejuvenate tired muscles and eases back painMeets all flammability standardsDimensionsTwin: 37 inches wide x 73 inches long Full: 52 inches wide x 73 inches longQueen: 58 inches wide x 78 inches longKing: 75 inches wide x 78 inches longCalifornia king: 70 inches wide x 82 inches longMemory Foam Tips: Remove from packaging within 72 hours to maximize expansion.This product arrives very tightly packed. Unwrap and allow 48 hours to return to original shape.Being sealed in plastic packaging sometimes traps odors. After unwrapping, allow product to air for a few hours.There may be slight variances in the dimensions.The firmness level of every item is unique. Please be advised that even similar products may produce different firmness results.Topper dimensions may be slightly smaller than mattress. Size has been designed to allow you to easily secure your fitted sheet over your new memory foam topper. to view mattress topper buying guide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JiAfBg78S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slumber Solutions","source_asin":"B087HRSDSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087HRSDSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087HRSDSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
