window.products.push({"id":1157542,"name":"Glaciart One Felt Mistletoe Ornament - with Hemp String, Easy Hanging - Cute DIY Christmas Ornaments for Home & Office - Hand Felted Ornaments Made in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815FOhXwUbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for new ornaments to liven up your home in time for the holidays? One of the best things about Christmas is that we can finally bring out special decorations and brighten up the house with that holiday cheer. It’s the most wonderful time of the year, after all! It’s only right for us to think of ways to transform our space in a way that suits our festive mood. However, using the same set of ornaments year in and year out can get a bit boring. So, instead of using the same accessories, why not add new ones to the mix? Spice up your holiday decorations with the Glaciart One Felt Mistletoe Ornament! This green mistletoe is hand-felted in Nepal using premium wool from New Zealand, so you're sure that it is soft and durable. Plus, you can add a few drops of your favorite holiday scents or essential oils to the fabric material so your rooms may also smell merry and joyful! You don't need Santa's elves to hang this decoration. Thanks to its hemp string, you'll be able to hang it on your Christmas tree or any wall with ease. You can also hang it from your doorway, window, or ceiling and get a chance to get that romantic holiday smooch under the mistletoe. We made sure that each accessory has no harmful elements that could cause itchiness and skin irritation. This way, you can hang it up even in the nursery or the kids’ playroom without worrying about the safety of your children. Since it’s made of wool, this decor can also act as a fertilizer when disposed of, making it a good choice for the environment. More reasons to decorate with this felted mistletoe: - Fuss-free cleaning and maintenance - Tinted with AZO-free dyes - Won't wear out or fade easily - Can be used for garlands and other arts and crafts projects Usher in the holiday season with charming ornaments. Add the Glaciart One Felt Mistletoe Ornament to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815FOhXwUbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glaciart One","source_asin":"B09B2SRK7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B2SRK7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B2SRK7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
