window.products.push({"id":1157592,"name":"Funland Mini Portable Humidifier for Plants, Small Indoor 650ml Cool Mist with 10 Filter Sticks, Night Lights, Auto-Shut off, Personal Quiet USB Attac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616l-7j6YkL._AC_SL1381_.jpg","description":"🌴Are you looking for Cool Mist Plant Humidifier for your small plants in the Home or office? 🌴Now, It's the ideal humidifier for you: 🌸Double Holes Heavy Mist - Large and cool mist spray, Giving your plants double moisturizing. 🌸2 Spray Modes - You could adjust the mist according to the own room's humidity. 🌸Night Lights - Normal light + breathing light design, creatively to meet your sleeping needs of lighting requirements. 🌸One Button Control - Easy to operate both for children and the old . 🌴From now on, we will have a fresh and moist living space and improve the quality of life. 🌴Specifications: Product Name: Plant Humidifier Product Size: 5.59×3.89×3.89inches Input Voltage: 5V Product Material: ABS, PP, PVC Water Capacity: 650ml Spray Volume: 30-40ml/h (Single Hole) 🌴You Will Get: Plant Humidifier ×1 Cotton Filter Sticks×10 Charging Cable×1 User Manual×1 🌴Notes For You: 1. It's recommended to add clean tap or mineral waters into humidifier. Pure or distilled water, Essential oil and perfumes are Forbidd. For it would cause water to accumulate at the mist outlet of humidifier and affect spray. 2. If you channge the cotton swab at the first time.Please take out the cotton swab from the plastic tube (not to lost that the spring inside ), soak it for 3-5 minutes, whole cotton swab is completely soaked and then reinstall it for using. 3. When the water level is lower than the safe water level, the humidifier will automatically stop working, which is a normal phenomenon. Just add water and restart to use. 💝If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are willing to answer your questions.💝","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616l-7j6YkL._AC_SL1381_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funland","source_asin":"B09MRWKJB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MRWKJB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MRWKJB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1157593,"name":"Mrs. Anderson’s Baking Cookie Ice Cream Scoop No.16, 18/8 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611nMphd9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mrs. Anderson’s Baking No.16 Cookie Scoop for portioning out equal amounts of cookie dough for perfectly round, equally sized cookies that bake evenly and look great. No more fighting over who gets the largest cookie! It’s easier than ever to calculate how many cookies each batch of dough will yield while create perfectly uniform cookies. Whether making homemade cookies from scratch or baking cookies using store-bought dough, Mrs. Anderson’s No.16 Cookie Scoop holds 4-tablespoon (2-ounces or ¼-cup) and yields 4 scoops per cup of dough. Tackle cookie projects quickly with the spring-action handle that allows a quick repetitive action. Scoop dough directly from mixing bowl to cookie sheet for faster prep and less mess. Easy to use. Simply scoop to fill with dough and level off the top with a butter knife or against the edge of the bowl. Position the scoop over the cookie sheet and squeeze the spring-action handle to easily release cookie dough directly where wanted. Great for scooping cookie dough, cupcake, muffin, and pancake batter, ice cream, rice, and forming meatballs, too. Made from 18/8 stainless steel with a spring-action handle for quick repetitive action, Mrs. Anderson’s No.16 food scoop holds 4-tablespoon (2-ounces or ¼-cup) to yield 4 scoops per cup. Dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Brought to you by HIC Harold Import Co.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611nMphd9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B074F54H2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F54H2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F54H2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
