window.products.push({"id":1157785,"name":"Vajrapani Custom Blanket with Name to My Granddaughter from Grandma Butterfly Personalized Blanket with Text Customized Throw Blanket for Kid Adult Bi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Js41xwUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ HOW TO CUSTOMIZE ? - Click \"Customize Now\" and enter the text you need (up to 30 characters), You can print the name of your daughter, son, granddaughter, grandson, mother, father, friends and anyone else you want on this beautiful blanket to make it their very own. This will be a most meaningful and loving gift. ❤ MULTI-FUNCTIONAL - It’s a good idea for giving to the one you love as a perfect gift on special occasions like birthday, graduation, mother’s day, anniversary, thanksgiving day, Christmas …You can imagine how happy it is to have this soft and unique blanket to relax on the sofa, while watching your favorite TV show, or as part of the bedding. You can even imagine the joy of they showing this blanket to others. ❤ THE BEST GIFT FOR EVERYONE - Trying to find the perfect gift can be stressful, so just relax and personalize this blanket, you’ve found the precise present they’re going to love. A custom gift shows how much you care, that you took the time and effort necessary to make something unique for that special someone. They don’t have to know it was a super easy process that took less than one minute, we’ll keep it our little secret! ❤ 5 SIZES AVAILABLE - 5 sizes for any age and height, with suitable sizes for children and adults, you can pick the right size to customize, note that XS 40 \"x30\" is a little small for adults or family use, but can be used for your childs (The average length of a child under 12 months is about 20 to 30 inches) , You can also design a customize blanket for your pet, dogs or cats with their name. ❤ WARM TIPS: ① This custom blanket is machine washable, please use a mild detergent to wash this blanket in cold water and do not iron. ② The blanket is printed in high definition on one side, the unprinted side is white. ③ We will print the NAME you text, not the ones we show, please let us know if there is anything you need and we will be happy to help you further! ④ Production takes 3-5 days, expedited delivery takes 3-5 days, standard delivery takes 4-8 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Js41xwUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vajrapani","source_asin":"B0BH7K8TH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH7K8TH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH7K8TH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
