window.products.push({"id":1157866,"name":"Tiny Tim Totes 83-DT5532 s Storage Bag, Large for 9 Foot Tree, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BtK6dXUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clean up after the holidays are a snap with the Premium Green Canvas Christmas Tree Bag from Tiny Tim Totes. A must-have after the holiday season, a Tiny Tim Totes Christmas tree bag will store your tree away neatly, effortlessly, and make for quick setup next year. It is as easy as placing your artificial Christmas tree in the bag, zip it up and safely store it away until next year. Because our tree bag is a full 52 inches long, 30 inches wide, and 30 inches deep, you will have no problem storing unassembled artificial trees and accessories up to 9 feet tall. This premium canvas bag has sturdy vinyl carry handles for easy transport. No assembly required, just unpack, unfold, and insert your tree. SATISFACTION : Tiny Tim Totes is committed to providing the consumer with the absolute best price and value on our entire line of products, which we ensure by applying a rigorous quality control process. NOTE: This is an exclusive product of Tiny Tim Totes and ONLY Christmas Tree Storage Bags by Tiny Tim Totes are to be genuine. IMPORTANT : Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers. Look for our logo on the packaging for every one of our products. Specifications: EXTRA LARGE- One bag is large enough to hold a 9 foot disassembled artificial Christmas tree. Dimensions: 52 x 30 x 30 inches (LxWxH). PROTECTIVE- Protect the center of your Holiday Decorations with this water, stain and tear-resistant canvas Christmas tree storage bag. STURDY- Lined in PVC, our Christmas tree bag has reinforced nylon handles so you can tote your Christmas cargo with less effort. DURABLE- Built to last, year after year and protect your artificial Christmas tree from dust, mildew and rodents. EASY TO USE- No assembly required. Simply place your tree in the bag, zip it up with the heavy-duty, full length zipper and label what is inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BtK6dXUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TINY TIM TOTES","source_asin":"B07KQY1P4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1157866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KQY1P4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KQY1P4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
